    "id": "question 5725",
    "verdict": "wrong",
    "correct_option": 1,
    "evidence": "Per TS 38.331 §5.2.2.4.2 and TS 38.304 §5.3.1, when a cell is barred, the UE 'shall exclude the barred cell as a candidate for cell selection/reselection for 300 seconds' (option 1). Selecting the same barred cell (options 3, 4) is not allowed; whether the UE selects another cell on the same frequency depends on intraFreqReselection. 'All of the above' (option 5) is wrong because options 3, 4 are not true.",
